{"duration": 38.568, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Gustave Eiffel hoisted a massive iron beam, then tossed it aside.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.699}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Critics shouted, \u201cIt looks like a giant grill\u2014useless and ugly!\u201d", "start": 4.119, "end": 7.697}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Eiffel watches the wind howl over Paris.", "start": 8.117, "end": 10.298}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He knows the storm could snap a solid tower like a twig.", "start": 10.518, "end": 13.422}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see how a bicycle\u2019s frame feels lighter when its tubes are spaced, not solid.", "start": 13.842, "end": 18.056}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Eiffel designs a lattice of criss\u2011crossing iron girders.", "start": 18.476, "end": 21.586}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The open web lets air flow through, cutting pressure on every point.", "start": 21.806, "end": 25.321}, {"beat": 4, "text": "At the same time the empty spaces shave off tons of weight.", "start": 25.541, "end": 28.589}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Because of that airy skeleton, the tower sways only nine centimeters in a gale.", "start": 29.009, "end": 33.197}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The \u201cugly grill\u201d became the world\u2019s most celebrated wind\u2011proof monument.", "start": 33.617, "end": 37.448}], "words": [{"w": "Gustave", "start": 0.128, "end": 0.528, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Eiffel", "start": 0.578, "end": 0.953, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hoisted", "start": 1.003, "end": 1.353, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.378, "end": 1.428, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "massive", "start": 1.478, "end": 1.828, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "iron", "start": 1.878, "end": 2.128, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "beam,", "start": 2.178, "end": 2.678, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "then", "start": 2.728, "end": 2.853, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "tossed", "start": 2.903, "end": 3.178, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "it", "start": 3.203, "end": 3.253, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w